hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2692","Narrated to us Muhammad ibn Bashshar, narrated to us Yahya ibn Sa'id, narrated to us 'Ubaydullah, who informed me Nafi', on the authority of Ibn 'Umar, on the authority of the Prophet (ﷺ):\n\n*\He spent the night at Dhu Tuwa until the morning"," then entered Makkah.\""*\n\n**CHAPTER:**"""
